              'route it through `uses: $actionUses` so the #726 bounded '
              'retry and the deterministic-skew fail-fast apply (gh-1310; '
              'the bare shapes lost the v1.0.516 build-macos leg to one '
              'transient git-clone reset).',
        );
      });

